Z||000004||GT Bastard||01-09-2000||04:32 PM||||I actually bought my '87 GT from Tea.  The guy worked at a repairables lot though, and he didn't seem to know anything.  I do know a couple of serious fanatics here in SF though. One guy in particular has about 8 fiero's and does good work from what I hear.  He works at a car lot/junk yard that's almost strictly Fiero's.  He seemed really nice.. He's into autocrossing and stuff and invited me to go with him.  I couple guys I work with here at Gateway are hardcore Fiero fanatics too.  It's wierd because In the other city I lived in, I had never even seen a fiero GT in person.   I think I'll be at the swapmeet, btw.||||reg||1
